		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Hairy, bipedal boar- humanoid, prone to fits of violence. Domineering.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 23, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tusk +5 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magic sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lycanthropy</strong>. If 12 or more damage from the same wereboar, contract lycanthropy.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rage</strong>. 1/day, immune to morale checks, +1d4 damage (3 rounds).</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
